+
+Version 0.4.19 adds the optional StrobeLights 0.10.38 stable-source extension
+for XmasLights 2.8. Its validated slot packets are inserted into the combined
+core shader while preserving TRP's original beam code and native v5 markers.
+This change is verified for the Paper 1.21.4 build. It does not change the
+standalone TRP renderer or imply support for external OptiFine shaderpacks.
 
